  "title": {
   "en": "Yang-senpai wa Hitori de Ikiteikenai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ヤン先輩はひとりで生きていけない"
   },
   {
    "en": "Yang Senior Cannot Live Alone."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yu is a serious and hardworking girl who can do anything without a problem, but is often told by boys that she is not cute. She wonders if she has to change this kind of self in order to become someone's number one. While she is having these problems, she meets a Chinese exchange student, Yang. He is good-looking and seemingly friendly, but one day Yu finds out his secret! \n\nA pure love story that begins with the good-hearted college girl and the puppyish Chinese boy relationship.",
   "ja": "真面目で努力家な女子大生・優雨はなんでも卒なくこなすけど 男子からは「可愛げない」と言われがち。 誰かの一番になるには、こんな自分を変えないとダメなのかーー。 そんな悩みを抱える中、中国人留学生のヤン先輩に出会う。 美形で一見ひとあたりも良い彼だが、ある日優雨は彼の秘密を知ってしまい！？ しっかりもの女子大生と子犬系中国人男子の ビジネスの関係から始まるピュアラブストーリー♥"
  },
